2026-10-20T21:06:14.1136266Z +               '## Example\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1138164Z +               'The following example shows code vulnerable to a partial SSRF attack, because it uses untrusted input (HTTP request parameter) directly to construct a URL. By using `../transfer-funds-to/123?amount=456` as the `user_id` value, the requested URL will be `https://api.example.com/transfer-funds-to/123?amount=456`. It also shows how to remedy the problem by validating the input.\n' +
