2026-10-20T21:06:14.1272807Z +               "Cookies without the `Secure` flag set may be transmitted using HTTP instead of HTTPS. This leaves them vulnerable to being read by a third party attacker. If a sensitive cookie such as a session key is intercepted this way, it would allow the attacker to perform actions on a user's behalf.\n" +
