2026-10-20T21:06:14.1274568Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1274699Z                 '## Recommendation\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1275327Z +               "Always set `secure` to `True`, or add `; Secure;` to the cookie's raw header value, to ensure SSL is used to transmit the cookie with encryption.\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1276128Z -               'If user input must be included in an XPath expression, either sanitize the data or use variable references to safely embed it without altering the structure of the expression.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1276219Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1276301Z                 '\n' +
